abstract: >-
  Publication-safe reproducibility package for the manuscript "Mining and
  Explaining Transactional Patterns with Entropy, Association Rules, and
  Statistical Models: A Reproducible Workflow for Operational Decision
  Support". The repository contains derived public datasets, executable
  analytical code, reference result tables, temporal validation, model and
  threshold sensitivity analyses, rule-prioritization checks, computational
  stress tests, figures, and reproducibility documentation.
